#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.flat_apply.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.flat\\_apply"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:1 of
msgid "Apply ``func`` to each row, expanding it to 0-N output rows."
msgstr "将 ``func`` 应用于每一行，将其扩展为 0-N 个输出行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:3 of
msgid ""
"``flat_apply`` is the LiteFrame analogue of ``mf.flatmap``: ``func`` "
"receives one row (a ``pandas.Series`` for "
"``input_frame_type=\"pandas\"``, a single-row ``polars.DataFrame`` for "
"``input_frame_type=\"polars\"``) and returns / yields 0-N new rows or a "
"new DataFrame.  Each returned row is aligned to the function-output "
"columns (dict / named-Series by key/label, list / tuple positionally, "
"scalar to a single column)."
msgstr ""
"``flat_apply`` 是 ``mf.flatmap`` 的 LiteFrame 对应物：``func`` 接收一行"
"数据（对于 ``input_frame_type=\"pandas\"`` 是 ``pandas.Series``，对于 ``"
"input_frame_type=\"polars\"`` 是单行 ``polars.DataFrame``）并返回/生成 0-"
"N 个新行或一个 新的 DataFrame。每个返回的行都对齐到函数输出列（按键/标签"
"的字典/命名 Series，按位置的列表/元组，标量到单个列）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:10 of
msgid ""
"Columns **not** in ``subset`` are *broadcast* (repeated for every output "
"row produced from the same input row), mirroring ``pandas.DataFrame. "
"explode``.  The function-output columns are inserted at the position "
"where the first ``subset`` column originally located; broadcast columns "
"keep their relative order around the func-out block."
msgstr ""
"不在 ``subset`` 中的列会被 *广播*（为从同一输入行生成的每个输出行重复），"
"类似于 ``pandas.DataFrame.explode``。函数输出列被插入到第一个 ``subset`` "
"列原来的位置；广播列在函数输出块周围保持它们的相对顺序。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:16 of
msgid ""
"Function taking one row and returning / yielding 0-N rows (a DataFrame, "
"generator, list-like, dict, Series, or scalar) or a tuple of such results"
" (multiple outputs).  If ``func`` is a class, it is instantiated once per"
" chunk, ``__call__`` is invoked per row, and ``close()`` (if defined) is "
"always called at the end of the chunk."
msgstr ""
"接收一行并返回/产生 0-N 行（DataFrame、生成器、类列表、字典、Series 或"
"标量）或此类结果的元组（多个输出）的函数。如果 ``func`` 是一个类，则每个"
"块实例化一次，每行调用 ``__call__``，并且 ``close()``（如果定义了）总是在"
"块结束时调用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:24 of
msgid ""
"Expected output dtypes for the **function-output** columns only (the "
"broadcast columns inherit their input dtypes automatically).  A list of "
"dicts/pd.Series declares multiple outputs.  If omitted, inferred from "
"``func``'s return annotation or a mock call."
msgstr ""
"仅针对**函数输出**列的预期输出数据类型（广播列自动继承其输入数据类型）。"
"字典/pd.Series 列表声明多个输出。如果省略，则从 ``func`` 的返回注解或模拟"
"调用中推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:29 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference and produce an untyped output."
msgstr "如果为 True，则跳过数据类型推断并产生无类型的输出。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:31 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:33 of
msgid ""
"Columns passed to ``func``.  ``None`` (default) passes all visible "
"columns (no broadcast columns, pure flatmap behaviour).  Columns not in "
"``subset`` are broadcast across the expanded output rows."
msgstr ""
"传递给 ``func`` 的列。``None``（默认值）传递所有可见列（无广播列，纯 "
"flatmap 行为）。不在 ``subset`` 中的列在扩展的输出行上进行广播。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:37 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:39 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:41 of
msgid ""
"A new LiteFrame (or tuple of LiteFrames for multiple outputs) whose "
"schema inserts the function-output columns at the position of the first "
"``subset`` column, with broadcast columns keeping their relative order."
msgstr ""
"一个新的 LiteFrame（或用于多个输出的 LiteFrame 元组），其模式在第一个 ``"
"subset`` 列的位置插入函数输出列，广播列保持它们的相对顺序。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:48 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:49 of
msgid ""
"The row count may change (1:N expansion), so -- like ``apply(axis=0)`` "
"and ``apply_chunk`` -- hidden columns are dropped from the UDF input and "
"not carried into the output.  Users who need a hidden column to travel "
"through ``flat_apply`` should ``select`` it first.  Range columns are "
"materialized to physical ``int64`` before the UDF runs; a broadcast range"
" column becomes a regular ``int64`` column in the output."
msgstr ""
"行数可能会改变（1:N 扩展），所以 -- 像 ``apply(axis=0)`` 和 ``apply_chunk"
"`` 一样 -- 隐藏列从 UDF 输入中被丢弃且不会传入输出。需要隐藏列通过 ``flat"
"_apply`` 传输的用户应该先 ``select`` 它。范围列在 UDF 运行前被实例化为"
"物理 ``int64``；广播范围列在输出中变为常规 ``int64`` 列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:58 of
msgid ":py:obj:`apply_chunk`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:59 of
msgid "Apply a function per execution chunk."
msgstr "每个执行块应用一个函数。"

