msgid ""
"Use ``subset`` to broadcast non-subset columns (``B`` is repeated for "
"every expanded row):"
msgstr "使用 ``subset`` 来广播非子集列（``B`` 在每个扩展行中重复）："

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.flat_apply.flat_apply:89 of
msgid "Return ``None`` to drop an input row (0 output rows):"
msgstr "返回 ``None`` 以丢弃输入行（0 输出行）："


